# Cross-Project Reference Check

When preparing a **PR** or **Issue** for this project (lws), always check the following related projects for similar issues, solutions, or PRs:

- [kueue](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kueue) — Job queueing / admission control
- [jobset](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/jobset) — Multi-template job orchestration
- [kubernetes](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes) — Core Kubernetes

## What to look for

1. **Similar issues**: Has the same bug or feature request been filed in these projects?
2. **Similar solutions**: Has a related problem already been solved? Can we reuse the approach?
3. **Similar PRs**: Are there open or merged PRs tackling comparable changes?

## How to search

Use `gh search issues` / `gh search prs` or browse the GitHub UI for each repo. Include relevant findings (links) in the PR/Issue description to provide context for reviewers.

## Example workflow

```bash
# Search for related issues across the three projects
gh search issues "your keywords" --repo kubernetes-sigs/kueue --repo kubernetes-sigs/jobset --repo kubernetes/kubernetes
# Search for related PRs
gh search prs "your keywords" --repo kubernetes-sigs/kueue --repo kubernetes-sigs/jobset --repo kubernetes/kubernetes
```
